{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26641","headline":"病中书事寄友人 · 姚合","name":"病中书事寄友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"终日自缠绕，此身无适缘。\n万愁生雨夜，百病凑衰年。\n多睡憎明屋，慵行待暖天。\n疮头梳有蝨，风耳乱无蝉。\n换白方多错，回金法不全。\n家贫何所怨，将在老僧边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26641.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26641","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}